# Agent Run 状态机

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: POST /agent-runs
    pending --> running: executor starts
    pending --> cancelled: user cancels
    pending --> failed: startup recovery / scheduling error
    running --> completed: plan persisted
    running --> degraded: safe fallback result
    running --> failed: unhandled error / deadline
    running --> cancelled: user cancels
    completed --> [*]
    degraded --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
```

终态不可再次转移。每次终态变化必须写对应 `agent_events`。
